duct Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p>The D CORE AC/DC Adapter DC 12V 0.5A (EU Type) is a high-quality and stable power supply designed for routers, CCTV cameras, LED strips, mini electronic devices, and other 12V low-power applications. Built with premium components, this adapter ensures reliable performance, low power consumption, and long-lasting durability.</p><p><br></p><p>Supporting 100–240V AC input, it works smoothly with Bangladesh’s electrical system. The standard EU 2-pin plug and 5.5×2.1mm DC connector make it compatible with a wide range of home and office equipment. With built-in protection against over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit, the D CORE 12V 0.5A adapter ensures maximum safety and device protection.</p><p><br></p><p>Perfect for users looking for a compact, energy-efficient, and dependable 12V power adapter at an affordable price from D CORE.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Input: AC 100–240V, 50/60Hz</li><li>Output: 12V DC, 0.5A (500mA)</li><li>EU-Type 2-pin plug for universal compatibility</li><li>Standard 5.5mm × 2.1mm DC connector</li><li>Premium build with stable voltage output</li><li>Energy-efficient &amp; low heat generation</li><li>Short-circuit, over-voltage &amp; over-current protection</li><li>Ideal for routers, switches, CCTV, LED strips &amp; small electronics</li><li>Durable cable with strong insulation for long-term use</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/acdc-power-adapter-dc-12v-3a-us-type\">AC/DC Power Adapter DC 12V 3A (US Type)</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">450৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">500৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/dcore-acdc-adapter-dc-12v-1a-eu-type\">D CORE AC/DC Adapter DC 12V 1A (EU Type)</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                  